        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin x+\\sin x\\cos x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sin x(1+\\cos x)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sin x+\\sin x\\cos x&=\\sin x(1+\\cos x)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos x-\\sin x\\cos x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos x(1-\\sin x)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos x-\\sin x\\cos x&=\\cos x(1-\\sin x)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\sin^2x-\\sin x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sin x(\\sin x-1)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sin^2x-\\sin x&=\\sin x(\\sin x-1)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q6-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\cos^2x+\\cos x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos x(\\cos x+1)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos^2x+\\cos x&=\\cos x(\\cos x+1)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q6-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$2\\sin^2x+\\sin x-1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(2\\sin x-1)(\\sin x+1)$",
          "worked": "Let $u=\\sin x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2u^2+u-1&=2u^2+2u-u-1\\\\&=2u(u+1)-(u+1)\\\\&=(2u-1)(u+1).\\end{align*}$$\nHence $2\\sin^2x+\\sin x-1=(2\\sin x-1)(\\sin x+1)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q6-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\sin^2x-\\cos^2x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(\\sin x-\\cos x)(\\sin x+\\cos x)=-\\cos 2x$",
          "worked": "Using the difference of squares,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin^2x-\\cos^2x&=(\\sin x-\\cos x)(\\sin x+\\cos x).\\end{align*}$$\nAlso, $\\cos 2x=\\cos^2x-\\sin^2x$, so $\\sin^2x-\\cos^2x=-\\cos 2x$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      }
    ]
